## Runtime-Wide Same-Disease Gate

The master guide now includes Stage 5A, which requires crawling every product answer lane, worker handoff lane, artifact handoff lane, web/currentness lane, repo-question lane, browser/computer lane, and recovery/escalation lane for deterministic answer-shaping remnants after visible parity. That stage locks the end-state rule:

Deterministic layers may observe and enforce. They may not author product answers in place of the selected model.

